OL,3,AGovernment must act now or lose Royal
OL,4,AMail, former minister warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer Business Secretary Peter Kyle
OL,7,Fhas said the government must act
OL,8,Furgently to "level the playing field"
OL,9,Ffor Royal Mail or risk the business
OL,10,Fbecoming unviable.
OL,12,FHe said he was concerned that the firm
OL,13,Fwas being "undercut" by rival parcel
OL,14,Fdelivery firms who did not employ staff
OL,15,Funder the same conditions.
OL,17,FRoyal Mail, which is owned by
OL,18,FInternational Distribution Services,
OL,19,Fhas struggled in recent years with
OL,20,Fincreased competition, fewer letters
OL,21,Fbeing sent and fines from the regulator
OL,22,Ffor missing delivery targets.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
